<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="title">音乐会选座</view>
    <view class="subtitle">请输入购票订单号，核验后即可选座</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="field">
      <text class="label">订单号</text>
      <input
        class="input"
        placeholder="粘贴你在微信小店购票得到的订单号"
        value="{{orderNo}}"
        bindinput="onOrderInput"
        confirm-type="done" />
    </view>
    <view class="field">
      <text class="label">手机号后4位</text>
      <input
        class="input"
        type="number"
        maxlength="4"
        placeholder="购票时填写的手机号后四位"
        value="{{phone4}}"
        bindinput="onPhoneInput" />
    </view>

    <button class="verify-btn btn-primary" loading="{{verifying}}" disabled="{{verifying}}" bindtap="onVerify">核验并选座</button>
  </view>

  <view class="tips">
    <view class="tip-title">购票说明</view>
    <view class="tip-line">1. 在「微信小店」按票档（A区/B区/C区）下单购票</view>
    <view class="tip-line">2. 付款成功后获得订单号</view>
    <view class="tip-line">3. 回到本小程序输入订单号，核验通过后在对应区域选座</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{demoMode}}" class="demo">
    演示模式：输入任意订单号即可本地核验（默认 A区·1座）
  </view>
</view>
